# 🎨 Anuragini Creations — Invitation Maker

**Anuragini Creations** is a web-based design studio project developed as a BCA mini project. It allows users to explore invitation designs, receive design recommendations, place sample orders, and create personalized slideshow videos.

## 📌 About the Project

The main objective of this project is to provide a simple and interactive platform for creating invitation ideas and personalized slideshow videos for different occasions. The website combines creative design options with a rule-based recommendation system to help users choose suitable themes, colours, and styles.

## ✨ Features

- **Login and Signup Interface:** Provides a basic login and registration interface using browser local storage.
- **Invitation Maker:** Explore design categories for birthdays, weddings, baby showers, and Christmas.
- **Design Services:** Displays formal invitations, informal invitations, logo designs, and posters.
- **Portfolio Gallery:** Showcases sample design concepts.
- **Rule-Based AI Recommendation System:** Suggests themes, fonts, and colour palettes based on the selected design type, formality, and mood.
- **Slideshow Video Maker:** Upload multiple photos and create personalized slideshow previews.
- **Customizable Videos:** Choose an occasion, theme, name, message, photo duration, and transition effect.
- **Download Video:** Export slideshow recordings in a browser-supported video format.
- **My Creations:** Save slideshow project details in local storage, reload them, and delete saved entries.
- **Order Form:** Enter customer details, select a design category, and provide special requirements.
- **Responsive Layout:** Uses flexible layouts to accommodate different screen sizes.

## 🛠️ Technologies Used

- **HTML5** — Structure of the website.
- **CSS3** — Styling, layouts, colours, and responsive design.
- **JavaScript** — Interactive features, form handling, design recommendations, and slideshow functionality.
- **HTML5 Canvas API** — Drawing slideshow frames.
- **MediaRecorder API** — Recording slideshow previews as video.
- **Browser Local Storage** — Storing basic account details and saved project information.
- **Google Fonts (Poppins)** — Typography.

